### POST : créer une option
POST http://localhost:8081/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/options
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeOption": 6,
  "libelle": "Biologie",
  "domaine": "Biologie",
  "responsable": "Mme Responsable Biologie",
  "credits": 20,
  "semestre": 2,
  "capacite": 20
}

### GET : lister les options
GET http://localhost:8081/Gestion_Options_Etudiants/rest/options